  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to UNICEF&apos;s thematic funding windows 2018-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As part of the Strategic Partnership Agreement with UNICEF, Denmark provides support for the following thematic funds for country-level activities in Mali, Niger and Burkina Faso:

- Child Protection - with the aim of improving and advocating for equitable prevention of and response to violence, abuse, exploitation and neglect of children.
- Education - with the aim of of improving learning outcomes as well as advocate for equitable and inclusive education. UNICEF will continue its focus on access and learning in primary education.
- Health - with the aim of improving and advocating for equitable use of high-impact maternal, newborn and child health interventions from pregnancy to adolescence and promotion of healthy behaviors.</narrative>
  </description>
